// Grounded Brain: how it works (README overview)
// Eraser "Flow Chart" diagram-as-code
title How Grounded Brain works
direction right
colorMode bold

User [shape: oval, icon: user, color: gray]
Express API [icon: nodejs, color: green, label: "Express API (TypeScript)"]
PostgreSQL [icon: postgres, color: blue, label: "PostgreSQL (Prisma)"]
Inngest [icon: zap, color: purple, label: "Inngest background jobs"]
OpenAI [icon: openai, color: orange]
Pinecone [icon: database, color: blue]
Mem0 [icon: brain, color: purple]

User > Express API: add sources, ask questions
Express API > PostgreSQL: save
Express API > Inngest: events
Inngest > OpenAI: extract · chunk · embed
Inngest > Pinecone: index vectors
Inngest > Mem0: learn memories
Express API > Pinecone: question → relevant chunks
Express API > Mem0: relevant memories
Express API > OpenAI: grounded answer (streamed)
Express API > User: streamed reply + citations
